 - - 0 11"}],"annotations":[{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment0:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment0","raw_text":"《弈林新编》杨官璘编著","text":"《弈林新编》杨官璘编著","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":0,"anchor_node_id":"root","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment9:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment9","raw_text":"1。目的扰乱黑方局势，看黑方如何应付，然后采取进攻策略。但将来黑方有上士捉车，而红车又必须逃走，这样在度数方面有些空虚。不如改走兵七进一，较有先手。","text":"1。目的扰乱黑方局势，看黑方如何应付，然后采取进攻策略。但将来黑方有上士捉车，而红车又必须逃走，这样在度数方面有些空虚。不如改走兵七进一，较有先手。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":9,"anchor_node_id":"0:9","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment15:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment15","raw_text":"2.如改走车六平三，局势比较平稳。","text":"2.如改走车六平三，局势比较平稳。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":15,"anchor_node_id":"0:15","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment19:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment19","raw_text":"3。如改走马八进七去卒，则车8平7去兵，黑方便宜。","text":"3。如改走马八进七去卒，则车8平7去兵，黑方便宜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":19,"anchor_node_id":"0:19","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment24:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment24","raw_text":"4。避免红马威胁，又防守卧槽，稳健之着。如改走车8平6，则车九平八捉马，红方优势。","text":"4。避免红马威胁，又防守卧槽，稳健之着。如改走车8平6，则车九平八捉马，红方优势。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":24,"anchor_node_id":"0:24","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment25","raw_text":"5。改走车九平四较稳。","text":"5。改走车九平四较稳。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"0:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment29:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment29","raw_text":"6。劣着，贪得一士，因而受困，并影响全盘局势。改走前车进四捉炮，尚有很大变化。","text":"6。劣着，贪得一士，因而受困，并影响全盘局势。改走前车进四捉炮，尚有很大变化。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":29,"anchor_node_id":"0:29","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment32:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment32","raw_text":"7。利用闲着进卒，威胁红方阵地，是稳中求胜的策略。现在形势，黑方采取这样的策略是对的。","text":"7。利用闲着进卒，威胁红方阵地，是稳中求胜的策略。现在形势，黑方采取这样的策略是对的。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment40:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment40","raw_text":"8。佳着，争取度数，奠下获胜基础。","text":"8。佳着，争取度数，奠下获胜基础。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":40,"anchor_node_id":"0:40","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment48:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment48","raw_text":"(图二二七)","text":"(图二二七)","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":48,"anchor_node_id":"0:48","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment64:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment64","raw_text":"黑胜。","text":"黑胜。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":64,"anchor_node_id":"0:64","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_25:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment1_25","raw_text":"红方优势。","text":"红方优势。","source_line_id":"1","source_after_ply":25,"anchor_node_id":"1:25","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_20:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment2_20","raw_text":"黑方便宜。","text":"黑方便宜。","source_line_id":"2","source_after_ply":20,"anchor_node_id":"2:20","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_pver":["091016"],"DhtmlXQ_viewurl":["?owner=u&id=69739&f=&isSave="],"DhtmlXQ_adddate":["2008-2-24 22:50:00"],"DhtmlXQ_editdate":["2008-2-24 22:50:00"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["第九局 顺炮横车对直车"],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_firstnum":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_length":["0"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["全局"],"DhtmlXQ_gametype":["慢棋"],"DhtmlXQ_open":[""],"DhtmlXQ_class":["象棋谱大全-现代棋书专集"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["弈林新编-杨官璘著"],"DhtmlXQ_group":[""],"DhtmlXQ_round":["8.对局评注"],"DhtmlXQ_table":[""],"DhtmlXQ_date":["1952年9月27日"],"DhtmlXQ_place":["上海市"],"DhtmlXQ_timerule":[""],"DhtmlXQ_red":["林弈仙"],"DhtmlXQ_redeng":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_redtime":[""],"DhtmlXQ_black":["杨官璘"],"DhtmlXQ_blackeng":